# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a

# Binaries built from ./cmd. Anchored to the repository root so that a package
# directory of the same name is never ignored by accident.
/gatewaydns
/bin/
/dist/

# `go test -c` and `go test` leave these behind when a run is interrupted.
*.test

